WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000021392 — Episode 61 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.520
There must be hundreds of feral dragons down there. Did they really just throw their lives away?

2
00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:08.080
No. That dark energy doesn't kill them, it feeds them. They struck a deal with the feral alpha.

3
00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:10.400
The feral alpha? Is that some kind of beast lord?

4
00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:14.960
Yes, the feral alpha is the source of every drop of their dark magic. No one alive has ever laid eyes of it.

5
00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:17.600
Ares! Forget about me! Run!

6
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:21.760
My father is down there! Luring us to the bottom! That was their end game all along!

7
00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:23.840
Once we go down there, there's no coming back up.

8
00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:29.200
Seraphina, are you sure? You don't have to die for me. I can't even channel my own power yet.

9
00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:32.880
I'm with you to the end, Ares. This isn't a favor. It's a vow.

10
00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:40.750
Then I'll protect you to my last breath. I swear it on my life.

11
00:00:42.510 --> 00:00:45.470
What's down there is likely a one-way trip.
